When you have installed the HSD05 in the BA353 do check the SCSI ID 
settings of the BA353. The HSD05 should have the SCSI ID 7 and all other 
devices should have an unique and lower (priority) ID. The HSD05 SCSI ID 
is set by dip switches inside the SBB module and defaults at 7. Because 
I've not tried the HSD05 in a BA353, I'm not sure how the ID settings of 
the BA353 will behave with a HSD05.
Anyway, it should work like in a BA350.

Good luck!

Regards,

Kari



